	id="the-problem"
	title="The Problem"
	description="With <strong>6000+ engineers</strong> shipping frontend code but <strong>very limited frontend specialists</strong>, we faced a critical platform problem: <strong>How do you maintain frontend quality when most engineers aren't frontend experts?</strong> Documentation alone wasn't enough; we needed automated quality guardrails that shifted left from code review to development time."
