        '<strong>Generic Error Messages:</strong> "Use semantic color" without guidance', 
        '<strong>Manual Validation:</strong> Developers must remember all standards', 
        '<strong>Delayed Feedback:</strong> Issues caught in code review, not development']
		},
		{
			icon: 'line-md:alert-twotone-loop',
			iconColor: 'text-amber-500',
