        '<strong>10-15 min CI/CD feedback</strong> - Issues caught too late']
		},
		{
			icon: 'line-md:alert-twotone-loop',
			iconColor: 'text-amber-500',
			title: 'Productivity Crisis',
			content: [
        '<strong>Backend/full-stack engineers</strong> shipping UI without frontend expertise', 
        '<strong>30-40% of engineer time</strong> searching docs, Stack Overflow, asking for help', 
